OL,3,AChemistry Nobel awarded for solving
OL,4,Amystery of life's asymmetry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building blocks to make living
OL,7,Forganisms on Earth only works with one
OL,8,Fversion. The two scientists answered
OL,9,Fthe question of why life favours one of
OL,10,Fthese mirror image molecules over the
OL,11,Fother.
